# What Cloudflare must NOT publish.
#
# Wrangler uploads everything in the assets directory, and the assets directory
# here is the repo root. Without this file the 2026-07-26 deploy began uploading
# /.git/ — which would make the entire commit history publicly downloadable,
# including commits before 339ab3b that still contain real passport numbers.
#
# Only the two app files (index.html · ocr.html) should ever reach the internet from this repo.
.git
.git/**
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.toml
README*
*.md
